{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104125","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104125/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104125/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104125/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104125","id":2920414403,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc6uEfzD","number":104125,"title":"In the same script, a gutter icon is missing when a method in an inner class overriding the base one from another inner class.","user":{"login":"Lazy-Rabbit-2001","id":22123964,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMTIzOTY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22123964?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001","html_url":"https://github.com/Lazy-Rabbit-2001","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-03-14T14:35:18Z","updated_at":"2026-03-04T14:42:36Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n4.5dev, but would be reproducible from 4.0 to 4.4.1(rc1)\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 11\n\n### Issue description\n\nSource from https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103859#issuecomment-2721031078\nI'd've thought that this was a \"feature\", but @HolonProduction told me on Rocket Chat that this would be a bug that should be fixed. So I post it here.\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nCopy the example script and paste it in the script editor of Godot\n```GDScript\nextends RefCounted\n\nclass A:\n    var _t=1\n\n    func _test() -> void:\n        _t=2\n\nclass B extends A:\n    func _test() -> void: # No gutter at the left side. Believe it or not.\n        pass\n```\nAnd check if there is an overriding icon in the gutter\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nSince this is simple enough to reproduce, the MRP is the code itself.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104125/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104125/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}